{
  "info": {
    "name": "Hospital Queue API",
    "description": "Frontend and mobile authentication handoff. See AUTH-INTEGRATION.md. Set collection variables before use. Enter the latest email OTP manually for each flow. Do not run the whole collection unattended. Clear credentials and tokens before sharing a used export.",
